  ],
  "description": "A LinkML model of the Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) 2.3 of the W3C Data Privacy Vocabularies and Controls Community Group. DPV states each concept as a class and as an instance of a broader concept, so the model holds its terms as records: each concept that terms are instances of is a class, each property is a slot under its own IRI, and every term of DPV's vocabularies is a record that validates against them.",
  "title": "Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV)",
  "comments": [
    "The version is the DPV release the schema renders. upstream/ holds its Turtle files unchanged, scripts/dpv_to_linkml.py writes the terms, the kinds and the catalogue from them, and scripts/check_upstream_release.py reports when they move."
  ],
  "source": "https://w3id.org/dpv/2.3",
  "see_also": [
    "https://lmodel.github.io/dpv",
    "https://w3id.org/dpv"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "privacy",
    "data protection",
    "personal data",
    "DPV",
    "GDPR",
    "vocabulary"
  ],
  "id": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/dpv",
  "version": "2.3",
  "imports": [
    "linkml:types",
    "./dpv_core",
    "./dpv_terms",
    "./dpv_kinds",
