      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/dpv/DpvConcept",
      "description": "A term DPV states as a concept and a class. Its rdf_type names the concepts it is an instance of, each a class of this schema, where DPV states one.",
      "title": "Concept",
      "comments": [
        "It holds the DPV properties some term of the vocabularies states. A thing a use case describes takes DpvResource, which holds them all."
      ],
